# Crafter-pricer (MarginCraft) needs no environment variables.
#
# It is a static website. Every API key (AI service, web search, Cloudflare
# image generation) is entered by the user in Settings → Integrations and
# stays in that user's browser (localStorage). Nothing is read from .env at
# build time or run time.
#
# If a server part is ever added, list each variable here with an empty value:
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
